@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Decide a duel
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Traveller" as a
actor "Desk holder" as b
box "Frontend — game" #E0F2FE
  participant "DuelPage" as page
  participant "FriendsGame" as session
end box
box "Frontend — api" #E0F2FE
  participant "RoomConnection" as conn
end box
box "Backend — AroundTheWorld.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "RoomHub" as hub
end box
box "Backend — AroundTheWorld.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "SubmitAnswerCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "RoomGame, Duel and Tour" as tour
end box
box "Backend — AroundTheWorld.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Room store" as db
end box
hub --> conn : GameChanged to the whole room in one step, its card without the answer (L2-026 criterion 5)
conn --> session : GameState, kept in place of the last
session --> page : duel signal, from FriendsView
page --> a : Flash card
page --> b : Flash card
a -> page : Answer
page -> session : answer(value)
session -> conn : answer(number), only while the card is open and the player not frozen
conn -> hub : SubmitAnswer(number), no time and no claim (L2-026 criteria 1, 2)
hub -> handler : Send SubmitAnswerCommand (validated 0 to 999, L2-044)
handler -> handler : Read the arrival time from TimeProvider
handler -> db : Load the room the token names
db --> handler : Room with its game
handler -> tour : Answer(player, answer, receivedAt): first run what fell due by then
tour -> tour : Check against the flash card the server made (L2-026 criterion 3)
alt the sender is not in the duel, is frozen, or the duel is already won
  tour --> handler : Ignored (L2-001 criteria 3, 4; L2-026 criterion 4); nothing is sent
else the answer is wrong
  tour --> handler : Wrong: frozen for 1 second from receivedAt (L2-004)
  handler -> db : Save with the room's version
  handler -> hub : IRoomNotifier.GameChangedAsync
  hub --> conn : GameChanged with the freeze left and the wrong answer
else the answer is correct and the first to arrive
  tour -> tour : Apply the hop, passing the empty desk, or the change of traveller (L2-002, L2-003)
  tour --> handler : Won; the next card is due 3.8 s later, or the tour is over (L2-006)
  handler -> db : Save with the room's version
  alt another change was saved first
    db --> handler : Refused as a whole
    handler -> tour : Apply the same answer, same arrival, to the room as it now stands (ADR 0033)
  end
  handler -> hub : IRoomNotifier.GameChangedAsync (and RoomChanged when the tour is over)
  hub --> conn : Result, new traveller, every position, to the whole room (L2-027 criterion 1)
  conn --> session : GameState
  session --> page : duel and tour signals
  page --> a : Result within 1 second
  page --> b : Result within 1 second
end
note over hub, db : RoomTimers sends AdvanceGamesCommand every 250 ms: the next card from FlashCardMaker,\na classmate's answer and a card's time running out each run at their own time, and go out as GameChanged
@enduml
